# Root-level one-off investigation/diagnostic scripts left by past agent sessions.
# All 76 existing root *.mjs were verified untracked and unreferenced debug
# remnants (git ls-files --others + rg across tools/host/integrations/desktop).
# Root is not the repository script home (tools/ and host/scripts/ are); keep
# these patterns root-anchored so tools/*.mjs and host/*.mjs stay tracked.
